{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MONOMOON is a tiny game about exploration and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/extras/1463d06f62760e04386aca6f98089f27.poster.avif?t=1771831865\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/extras/1463d06f62760e04386aca6f98089f27.webm?t=1771831865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/extras/1463d06f62760e04386aca6f98089f27.mp4?t=1771831865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no proper instructions, you must deduce and achieve your goals as you solve puzzles, find mysterious items, and uncover secrets hiding right under your nose.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a small  open world\u00a0&quot;Metroidbrainia&quot; that you can (probably) complete in a few hours, or dig deeper  to find all that's hidden within.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layers of secrets, ranging from simple puzzles to cryptic mysteries and hidden game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of platformer and point and click control schemes, utilizing both the keyboard and mouse. (Controllers are also supported)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear exploration and progression - explore and discover things at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All puzzles and secrets can be solved by playing the game solo, and all clues exist within the game itself. However, we encourage discussing your playthrough with a friend to share knowledge and hints with one another.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3285880?t=1771831865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3285880?t=1771831865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/f952731af010fbb871ffcccf6a7c5ba56483bd51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771831865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/f952731af010fbb871ffcccf6a7c5ba56483bd51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771831865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > MONOMOON is a tiny game about exploration and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/extras/1463d06f62760e04386aca6f98089f27.poster.avif?t=1771831865\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/extras/1463d06f62760e04386aca6f98089f27.webm?t=1771831865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/extras/1463d06f62760e04386aca6f98089f27.mp4?t=1771831865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no proper instructions, you must deduce and achieve your goals as you solve puzzles, find mysterious items, and uncover secrets hiding right under your nose.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a small  open world\u00a0&quot;Metroidbrainia&quot; that you can (probably) complete in a few hours, or dig deeper  to find all that's hidden within.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layers of secrets, ranging from simple puzzles to cryptic mysteries and hidden game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of platformer and point and click control schemes, utilizing both the keyboard and mouse. (Controllers are also supported)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear exploration and progression - explore and discover things at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All puzzles and secrets can be solved by playing the game solo, and all clues exist within the game itself. However, we encourage discussing your playthrough with a friend to share knowledge and hints with one another.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","developers":["Gentle Giant"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285880/d47979f80e7e19ff0ffca75f42ba98a6238a3ce4/header.jpg?t=1771831865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3285880/1685637078/6a4e7ad05fde7d4b78fb43d512072a4a33f373f4/1756826964/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756828245","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3285880/1685637078/6a4e7ad05fde7d4b78fb43d512072a4a33f373f4/1756826964/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756828245","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3285880/1685637078/6a4e7ad05fde7d4b78fb43d512072a4a33f373f4/1756826964/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756828245","id":257192258,"name":"MONOMOON Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192258/654a4e43d6f8256435496c630ced9c4e9494e639/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756828245"}],"name":"MONOMOON","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memo